{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42569","headline":"畊夫谣 · 徐仲雅","name":"畊夫谣","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"张绪逞风流，王衍事轻薄。\n出门逢畊夫，颜色必不乐。\n肥肤如玉洁，力拗丝不折。\n半日无畊夫，此辈总饿杀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐仲雅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_42569.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_42569","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}